&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drives everything we do. Our People team are the architects of a great workplace where brilliant minds come together to do their best work. From discovering diverse talent and nurturing future leaders, to creating spaces that spark collaboration and crafting rewards that celebrate success - we&#39;re passionate about building a culture where everyone can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Technical Recruiter – Engineering to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us hire the engineers who design, build, and scale Deliveroo’s technology, from our mobile application to the complex systems powering every order.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Get to know our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/the-people-team/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;People&lt;/a&gt; team — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;You’ll be joining the Engineering Recruiting team. We partner directly with senior tech and product leaders to design strategies that attract, assess, and hire world-class technical talent across global markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead senior end-to-end hiring:&lt;/strong&gt; Own full-lifecycle recruitment for critical, highly technical positions (Principal Engineers, Staff Engineers, and Engineering Leadership), running tailored strategies that balance speed, quality, DE&amp;amp;I, and candidate experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted business advisor:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Heads of Engineering, Product, and People to shape role designs, influence hiring strategy, and align talent acquisition outcomes with broader business goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive data-led strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn market intelligence, recruiting metrics, and People Analytics dashboards into actionable insights to guide hiring manager decisions and optimize pipeline performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Optimise recruiting operations &amp;amp; bar-raising:&lt;/strong&gt; Refine assessment frameworks, streamline interview calibration, and partner with TA Operations to test new tools and maintain high data accuracy across systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Champion diversity, inclusion &amp;amp; candidate experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed inclusive practices into every stage of job design and sourcing, deliver an exceptional candidate journey, and mentor junior recruiters on best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
