&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;Proven experience leading end-to-end technical recruitment within a fast-paced, high-growth tech or product organisation, with substantial experience in global tech environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
