&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;Strong track record of hiring for complex, senior technical roles (Staff/Principal Engineers, Engineering Managers, or Technical Directors).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;Excellent sourcing and stakeholder management skills, with a demonstrated ability to influence senior engineering leaders and close top-tier talent in competitive markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;Fluency with recruitment data and tools, including experience using ATS platforms (such as Ashby), LinkedIn Recruiter, and market insight dashboards to inform strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead TA initiatives that improve hiring processes, equity, or candidate experience operating with high autonomy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience partnering with People Analytics teams to design custom recruiting performance dashboards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,1,0&quot;&gt;Prior experience mentoring and coaching mid-level recruiters or sourcers within an engineering talent team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
