&lt;p&gt;Employment at Scopely is based solely on a person&#39;s merit and qualifications. Scopely does not discriminate against any employee or applicant because of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition (including breastfeeding), or any other basis protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Are you a recent or soon-to-be graduate in physics, engineering or a related field, keen to apply your technical appreciation of physics and engineering to guide investment and business choices in the telecommunication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; sector? Are you fascinated by the changing way we communicate and share information and want to shape the future? Do you have a curious mindset and the drive to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;uncover challenges in making telecommunication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; technologies and processes work at a cost and scale that makes sense?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If so, then this could be a great role for you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;4gf4p&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;93fl2-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;93fl2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;93fl2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Successful candidates can join us between May and October 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;4gf4p&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;3cvnq-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;3cvnq-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3cvnq-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;There is no deadline for this role, as we recruit on a rolling basis. We encourage you to apply as soon as possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
