&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Advisory team works at the forefront of emerging technology, helping organisations turn innovation into commercial success. Although this role will spend most of its time supporting clients in the telecommunications sector, we encourage our consultants to bring their expertise across industries, particularly in areas where communications, infrastructure and energy are becoming increasingly intercon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;nected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work with a wide range of organisations, from fast-growing technology pioneers and infrastructure providers to telecoms operators and investors. Together, we help clients navigate uncertainty, evaluate opportunities and make informed strategic judgements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Projects typically involve assessing new markets, understanding competitive landscapes, shaping go-to-market strategies, supporting investment judgements and exploring future technology pathways. Our work covers cutting-edge technologies including direct-to-device services, non-terrestrial networks, high-altitude platform systems (HAPS) and emerging space-based communications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A critical part of Cambridge Consultants, o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ur Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; delivers projects to clients in the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Telecommunication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;sector. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our clients vary from &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ambitious &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;start-ups to multinationals,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;but all a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;spire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to use cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;telecommunication &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;technology to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;transform and innovate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; What we do is help them succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our work delivers insights for key business choices related to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;de&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ep &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;tech: developing go-to-market strategies, providing investment support, competitor analyses, market insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; technology road-mapping&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; and strategic foresight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;. The technologies we work with are broad and include the latest advances &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; lunar comms, direct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;device and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;high-altitude pseudo-satellites (HAPS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role sits within the ‘Research &amp;amp; Insights’ section of our Advisory group, which focuses on understanding how the near- and long-term future impacts the choices we make today. Examples include: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;W&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;hat are the next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;generation satellite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; services? How will terrestrial and satellite services seamlessly integrate? How &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;can &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;new technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;can &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;connect unconnected regions while remaining commercially viable?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
