&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently with senior-level autonomy while collaborating effectively with key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills; confident engaging with senior management teams, sponsors and advisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisation and project management, with ability to manage multiple complex workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, solutions-focused, results-driven attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constructive challenge mindset; willing to question assumptions and drive better outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with balanced judgement across risk, value and client outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership capability, coaching and developing junior talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
